      "content": "An over-the-counter pain reliever like naproxen (Aleve) or ibuprofen (Advil) often works best for combination pain involving headaches, stomach aches, and heartburn because they address inflammation. While acetyl-salicylic acid (aspirin) is also effective for headaches, it can sometimes irritate the stomach further and worsen heartburn. For the most immediate relief, take one recommended dose with a full glass of water and avoid eating anything spicy or acidic for the next few hours.",
